    <listOfParameters>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="F_dap_abs" name="fraction absorbed dapagliflozin" value="0.84" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>Fraction absorbed: <code>F_dap_abs</code> of the dapagliflozin of the intestinal
lumen is absorbed, <code>(1 - F_dap_abs)</code> is excreted in the feces. 15.4 % of
an oral dose is excreted unchanged in the feces [Obermeier2010]; with
the hepatic first pass the bioavailability is 0.78 [Boulton2013]. Not
fitted: only the feces of Obermeier2010 identify it.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000009" id="DAPABS_k" name="rate of dapagliflozin absorption" value="0.0444918821768688" units="per_min" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>First-order rate of the dapagliflozin leaving the lumen, absorbed
(<code>F_dap_abs</code>) or to the feces: tmax 1.0-1.25 hr fasted [Boulton2013,
Kasichayanula2013].</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
